<!-- @after 10. Further Reading :: recap -->
### Say these in the interview

- Choose the runtime per task and device; platform GenAI models and custom LiteRT models have different availability and update contracts.
- Keep SENSITIVE requests on device by a client-enforced rule; unavailable local inference means deferral or a hidden feature.
- Cloud fallback requires consent and policy permission, not only a network connection.
- For ML Kit GenAI, availability does not bypass foreground execution limits or AICore quotas.
- Validate model output and measure quality per model version without logging prompt or result content.
